      "sourceTextSha256": "ccfdfb051ff2b0322065a0b10b1c18e58a5ce457a96f2ed1907380b2fcf33256",
      "text": "Day 1 · Arrival at Rio de Janeiro airport, where a driver awaits you with a sign bearing your names, and transfer to the hotel. If you arrive before dusk, the road reveals green hills, rocky mountains, palm trees and beautiful bays; at nightfall, the lights of the hillside neighbourhoods surround the city like a shimmering necklace. Copacabana and Ipanema, with their black-and-white mosaic promenades and cafés open late, where you can quench your thirst with cold coconut water: you are in one of the most beautiful cities in the world.",
